Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:05.94,Title,0,0,0,0,,《邪恶力量》
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.40,0:00:13.88,Note,0,0,0,0,,（堪萨斯州 劳伦斯市 22年前）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.19,0:04:48.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（斯坦福大学 现今）
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.20,0:13:33.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（加利福尼亚州 耶利哥市）
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.62,0:18:58.29,Note,0,0,0,0,,（耶利哥市 7英里）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.32,0:23:04.28,Note,0,0,0,0,,（女性 谋杀 搭车）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.72,0:23:08.89,Note,0,0,0,0,,（0个结果）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.30,0:23:12.32,Note,0,0,0,0,,（女性 谋杀 百年纪念路）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.65,0:23:15.76,Note,0,0,0,0,,（0个结果）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.15,0:23:31.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（女性 自杀 百年纪念路）
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.35,0:28:37.01,Note,0,0,0,0,,（白衣女鬼）
Dialogue: 0,0:43:57.68,0:43:59.20,Note,0,0,0,0,,（想你爱你）
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:27.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}来向你弟弟说晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, let's say good night to your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:35.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 晚安 萨姆 - 晚安 宝贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}- 'Night Sam. - Good night, love.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.13,0:00:38.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}嘿 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey! Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.55,0:00:41.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 爸爸 - 小伙子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daddy! - Hey! Buddy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.97,0:00:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么看 萨姆可以打橄榄球了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think? Sam is ready to touch around football yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.68,0:00:46.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不行 爸爸 - 不行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, daddy. - No?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.60,0:00:48.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你来照顾他 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You got him? - I got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.77,0:00:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}做个好梦 萨米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sweet dreams, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.80,0:01:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰\N{\fnArial\fs30}John?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.74,0:01:48.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}约翰 他是不是饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}John, is he hungry?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.66,0:01:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.08,0:02:33.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.12,0:02:35.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.38,0:02:43.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.26,0:02:45.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.85,0:02:50.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.32,0:02:59.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨米\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.32,0:03:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.96,0:03:20.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.60,0:03:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.60,0:03:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}赶快把你弟弟带到外面去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your brother outside as fast as you can!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:38.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不要回头看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't look back!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.86,0:03:40.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点 迪恩 快跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, Dean! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.97,0:03:45.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}玛丽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.27,0:03:47.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.89,0:03:57.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没事的 萨米\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.25,0:04:11.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来 去救火\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got it. Go put the fire now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.14,0:04:14.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}给\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.91,0:04:32.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}往后站 你们得往后站\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay back. You have to stay back.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.13,0:04:49.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.14,0:04:51.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get a move on, would ya?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.85,0:04:53.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们应该15分钟前就到那了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were supposed to be there like 15 minutes ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.97,0:04:56.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你去还是不去啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, you coming or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.31,0:05:01.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我必须得去吗 - 是的 会很有趣的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do I have to? - Yes. It'll be fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.98,0:05:03.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么不化妆\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where's your costume?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:08.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道我对万圣节的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know how I feel about Halloween.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.20,0:05:18.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}祝贺萨姆和他法学院入学考试的高分\N{\fnArial\fs30}So here's to Sam and his awesome LSAT victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:19.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 好的 这没什么大不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right. It's not that big a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.66,0:05:22.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他看上去谦虚 但是他考了174分\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he acts all humble, but he scored a 174.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.54,0:05:25.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 算高分吗 - 高得吓人了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Is that good? - Scary good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.80,0:05:28.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}瞧啊 名校任你选了\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, there you go. You are a first-round draft pick.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.63,0:05:30.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想进哪个法学院都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can go to any law school you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.51,0:05:32.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上 我这周一就有个面试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually, I got an interview here monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.26,0:05:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果顺利 我想我明年有机会拿全金\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it goes okay, I think I got a shot at a full ride next year.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.43,0:05:38.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}肯定会顺利的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's gonna go great.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.73,0:05:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但愿吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It better.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.48,0:05:42.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}成为家中的金童感觉怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it feel to be the golden boy in your family?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.02,0:05:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不知道 要是我早美到天上了 干嘛不说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No? I would be gloating. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.89,0:05:48.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我们不是脱线家族\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because we're not exactly the Bradys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.94,0:05:50.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我也不是天才老爹家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not exactly the Huxtables.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.80,0:05:51.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}再喝点\N{\fnArial\fs30}More shots?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.50,0:05:53.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 不了 - 不 不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.11,0:05:55.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说真的 我为你感到骄傲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seriously, I'm proud of you,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:57.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周一你肯定让他们大吃一惊\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're gonna knock them dead on monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.16,0:05:58.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你会拿全额奖学金的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get that full ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.95,0:05:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.79,0:06:02.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有你我该怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would I do without you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.64,0:06:03.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为爱神伤吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Crash and burn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.60,0:07:07.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放松 小老虎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! Easy, tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.27,0:07:09.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.69,0:07:12.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你吓死我了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You scared the crap out of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.15,0:07:13.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那是因为你荒废了功夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's cause you're out of practice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.99,0:07:16.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.49,0:07:18.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}放开我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.09,0:07:20.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 你来这里到底要干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.78,0:07:22.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来找啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was looking for a beer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.37,0:07:25.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你到底要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, all right, we got to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.08,0:07:30.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 电话里不能说吗 - 我打你会接吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The phone? - If I'd called would you picked up?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.13,0:07:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.30,0:07:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess, hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.68,0:07:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 这是我的女朋友杰西卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, this is my girlfriend, Jessica.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.43,0:07:40.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 他是你哥哥迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. Your brother Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.39,0:07:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我喜欢蓝精灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love the Smurfs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:44.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道吗 我得说\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I got to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.33,0:07:46.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我弟弟真配不上你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are completely out of my brother's league.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.84,0:07:48.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我穿下衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just let me put something on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.61,0:07:52.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别别 我不会胡思乱想的 真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. No, I wouldn't dream of it, seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.32,0:07:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}总之 我借你男朋友一用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anyway, I got to borrow your boyfriend here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.64,0:07:56.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谈点家里私事\N{\fnArial\fs30}talk about some private family business,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.45,0:07:57.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很高兴见到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}but nice meeting you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.87,0:08:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不不 无论你想说什么 她都可以听\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. No, whatever you want to say, you can say it in front of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.87,0:08:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.42,0:08:09.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸好几天不在家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.38,0:08:12.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这怎么了 他在「米勒时间」加班呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So? He's working overtime on a "Miller Time" shift.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.61,0:08:14.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他迟早会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll stumble back in sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.78,0:08:20.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他外出狩猎 几天过去迟迟未归\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's on a hunting trip, and he hasn't been home in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.56,0:08:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西 失陪一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess, excuse us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:29.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要出去说\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to go outside.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.56,0:08:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我说 你不要半夜突然跑来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, you can't just break in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:34.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我和你一起出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and expect me to hit the road with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.24,0:08:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你没有听懂我的意思 萨姆 爸爸失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not hearing me, Sammy. Dad's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.36,0:08:38.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我需要你帮我找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to help me find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还记得阿姆赫斯特的捣蛋鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember the poltergeist in Amherst,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.89,0:08:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有克利夫顿的魔鬼之门吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}or the devil's gates in Clifton?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.37,0:08:43.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那两次他不也是失踪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was missing then, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.61,0:08:45.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他总是失踪 可又总是好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's always missing, and he's always fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.70,0:08:48.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是从没这么久 现在你跟不跟我走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for this long. Now, are you gonna come with me or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.37,0:08:49.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.75,0:08:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.50,0:08:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发过誓再也不去抓鬼了 永远不去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swore I was done hunting. For good.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.04,0:08:54.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行了 我们属实不易\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, it wasn't easy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.36,0:08:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 但也没那么糟糕 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but it wasn't that bad. - Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.42,0:08:58.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}小时候我告诉爸爸我害怕衣柜里有怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}When I told dad I was scared of the thing in my closet,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.56,0:08:59.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他却给我一支点45手枪\N{\fnArial\fs30}he gave me a.45.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.68,0:09:00.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他应该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:02.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我那时才9岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was 9 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.43,0:09:05.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他应该说「别怕黑」\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was supposed to say: "Don't be afraid of the dark."
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.77,0:09:07.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「别怕黑」 你逗我玩呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Don't be afraid of the dark"? Are you kidding me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.35,0:09:09.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你当然应当怕黑 你知道黑暗里有什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course, you should be afraid. You know what's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.56,0:09:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道 但是妈妈被杀后我们那种成长方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah I know but still… the way we grew up after mom was killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.65,0:09:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸着魔似地寻找杀死妈妈的那个东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}and dad's obsession to find the thing that killed her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.82,0:09:17.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我们还没有找到那个该死的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we still haven't found the damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.40,0:09:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以我们杀死能够找到的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we kill everything we can find.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.07,0:09:21.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这样做也救了很多人啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Save a lot of people doing it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.95,0:09:25.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得妈妈会希望我们这样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think mom would have wanted this for us?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.70,0:09:31.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}练习使用武器 给子弹里灌银\N{\fnArial\fs30}The weapon training and melting the silver into bullets?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.54,0:09:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 我们的成长历程完全是战士的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man, Dean, we were raised like warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.13,0:09:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那你想怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.38,0:09:38.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想过那种正常的美国式生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you just gonna live some normal, apple-pie life?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.13,0:09:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.84,0:09:41.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不是正常的 是安全的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not normal. Safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.72,0:09:43.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是你离家的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's why you ran away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.89,0:09:48.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我原本只是想上大学\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was just going to college.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:51.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是爸爸说如果我要走 就永远别回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was dad who said if I was gonna go, I should stay gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.19,0:09:54.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我现在也不会回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's what I'm doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.27,0:09:56.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸现在一定遇到了大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad's in real trouble right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.28,0:09:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果不是已经死了的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he's not dead already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.28,0:09:58.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能感觉到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can feel it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.24,0:10:02.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我一个人不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do this alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.91,0:10:04.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你可以的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you can.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.53,0:10:07.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 但我不想那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, I don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.71,0:10:17.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他追捕的是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was he hunting?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.05,0:10:26.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让我想想 我到底把它放哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Let's see. Where the hell did I put that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.30,0:10:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸走的时候 你怎么不跟他去\N{\fnArial\fs30}So when dad left, why didn't you go with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.52,0:10:29.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有自己的活儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was working my own gig…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.99,0:10:32.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}新奥尔良一桩巫毒事件\N{\fnArial\fs30}This voodoo thing down in New Orleans.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.44,0:10:35.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸让你独自抓鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad let you go on a hunting trip by yourself?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.61,0:10:36.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我26岁了 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm 26, dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.32,0:10:39.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 找到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.32,0:10:42.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}爸爸在查加利福尼亚的耶利哥市郊外\N{\fnArial\fs30}So dad was checking out this two-lane blacktop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.60,0:10:44.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一段双车道柏油路\N{\fnArial\fs30}just outside of Jericho, California.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.70,0:10:46.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个月前 这个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a month ago, this guy…
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.37,0:10:48.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人发现了他的车 但他不见了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They found his car, but he'd vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.50,0:10:49.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人间蒸发\N{\fnArial\fs30}Completely M.I.A.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.33,0:10:51.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许他被绑架了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So maybe he was kidnapped.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.91,0:10:53.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有理 4月份又一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, here's another one in April,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.08,0:10:56.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}12月一起 04年 03年\N{\fnArial\fs30}another one in December '04, '03,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.31,0:10:59.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}98年 92年 过去20年总共10起\N{\fnArial\fs30}'98, '92… 10 of them over the past 20 years…
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.20,0:11:02.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所有人都是在同一段5英里道路上出事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All men, all same 5-mile stretch of road.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.72,0:11:06.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}失踪事件越来越多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Started happening more and more, so.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.85,0:11:08.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以爸爸就去查了\N{\fnArial\fs30}dad went to go dig around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.35,0:11:10.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大约是3周前\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was about three weeks ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.52,0:11:12.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}打那以后一直没有他的消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hadn't heard from him since,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.10,0:11:12.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就够糟糕了\N{\fnArial\fs30}which is bad enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:16.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}昨天我又收到了这封语音邮件\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I get this voice mail yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.77,0:11:20.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 有事正在发生 我觉得很严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, something is starting to happen. I think it's serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.90,0:11:22.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我得搞清楚是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need to try to figure out what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.49,0:11:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}千万小心 迪恩 我们都很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be very careful, Dean. We're all in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.45,0:11:31.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}注意到里面的超自然电子异象了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know there's EVP on that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.08,0:11:34.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不错嘛 萨米 有些技艺就是忘不掉哈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad, Sammy. Kind of like riding a bike, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.62,0:11:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 我把它放慢\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. I slowed the message down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.56,0:11:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}通过GoldWave软件进行处理\N{\fnArial\fs30}and ran it through a goldwave,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.75,0:11:40.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去掉嘶嘶声 得到了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}took out the hiss, and this is what I got.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.05,0:11:45.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永远也回不了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.97,0:11:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}永远也回不了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Never go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.35,0:11:56.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道吗 快两年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, in almost two years,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.68,0:11:59.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我从未烦过你 从未要求你做任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never bothered you, never asked you for a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.32,0:12:08.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 我去\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, I'll go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.82,0:12:11.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我帮你找到他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll help you find him,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.54,0:12:13.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我周一一大早就要回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I have to get back first thing Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.79,0:12:14.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在这等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just wait here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.08,0:12:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}周一一大早你要干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's first thing monday?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.29,0:12:19.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've this…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.55,0:12:22.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我有个面试\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have an interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.46,0:12:24.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 工作面试 推了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? A job interview? Skip it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.05,0:12:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是法学院面试 我的未来就在眼前\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a law-school interview, and it's my whole future on a plate.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.43,0:12:31.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}法学院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Law school?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.22,0:12:33.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}行还是不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we got a deal or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.14,0:12:39.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}等等 你要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, you're taking off?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.94,0:12:41.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是为你爸爸的事吗 他还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this about your dad? Is he all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.57,0:12:43.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还好 家务事而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. You know, just a little family drama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.44,0:12:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但之前你哥哥说他外出捕猎什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But your brother said he was on some kind of hunting trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.15,0:12:49.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的 他去林中小屋附近猎鹿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he's just deer hunting up at the cabin,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.95,0:12:53.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}八成和吉姆 杰克和乔斯一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's probably got Jim, Jack, and Jose along with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.20,0:12:54.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们去接他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're just gonna go bring him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.87,0:12:55.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那面试怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the interview?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.75,0:12:57.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会去面试的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll make the interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.00,0:12:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我只去两天而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is only for a couple days.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.54,0:13:02.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 拜托 等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, I mean, please. Just stop for a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.21,0:13:04.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你确定你没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sure you're okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.17,0:13:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.05,0:13:10.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只是 你从不提及你的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just… You want even talk about your family.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.84,0:13:12.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在却要 三更半夜离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now you're taking off the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.50,0:13:13.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去和他们一起度周末\N{\fnArial\fs30}to spend the week-end with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.06,0:13:15.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}而且周一还有要事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And with Monday coming up…
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.39,0:13:16.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这不是你的风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just not kind of your style.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.93,0:13:19.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一切都会好起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, everything's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.06,0:13:22.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会及时回来 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would be back in time, I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.90,0:13:27.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少告诉我你去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least tell me where you're going!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.50,0:13:39.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾米 我今晚不能去找你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Amy, I can't come over tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.25,0:13:42.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}因为我明早要工作 这就是原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I got work in the morning, that's why.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.42,0:13:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要是翘班 我爸会杀了我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I miss it, my dad's gonna have my ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.34,0:13:54.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾米 等会我再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, uh, Amy, let me call you back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.40,0:14:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车子坏了还是怎么啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car trouble or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.07,0:14:15.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}送我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:18.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好的 上车吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.10,0:14:37.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你住哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where do you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.52,0:14:43.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}布雷肯里奇路的尽头\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the end of Breckenridge Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.44,0:14:47.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是从万圣节派对上回来的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're coming from a Halloween party or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.28,0:14:54.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}知道吗 像你这样的姑娘不该一个人在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, um, a girl like you really shouldn't be alone out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.50,0:15:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.76,0:15:21.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得我漂亮吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think I'm pretty?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.53,0:15:28.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和我一起回家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you come home with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.58,0:15:31.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um…Hell, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.06,0:15:53.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}拜托 你不会住在这里的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. You don't live here.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.85,0:15:56.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永远也回不了家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.65,0:16:00.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 你说什么 这里没人住\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? What are you talking about? Nobody lives here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.07,0:16:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你住哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Huh, where do you live?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.91,0:16:11.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.41,0:16:13.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别开玩笑了 好不好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Joke's over, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.25,0:16:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你想让我离开吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want me to leave?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.61,0:16:39.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.92,0:16:48.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.22,0:17:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}想吃早餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. You want breakfast?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.93,0:17:52.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.14,0:17:54.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么付账的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how'd you pay for that stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.73,0:17:56.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你和爸爸还在用信用卡欺诈吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and dad still running credit-card scams?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.06,0:18:00.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 猎鬼的收入可跟职业篮球没法比\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, hunting aingt exactly a pro-ball career.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:02.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有 我们只是申请\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, all we do is apply.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.96,0:18:04.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}银行寄卡过来 这又不是我们的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not our fault they send us the cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.53,0:18:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 这次你在申请表上填了谁的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, and what names did you write on the application this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.87,0:18:12.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}伯特·阿法米恩和他儿子赫克托\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh… Bert Aframian and his son, Hector.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.86,0:18:14.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一下办了两张卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scored two cards out of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.62,0:18:15.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听上去不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds about right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.12,0:18:19.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我发誓 你得升级你的磁带收藏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I swear, man, you got to update your cassette-tape collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.29,0:18:20.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.17,0:18:22.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第一 你这全是磁带\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, for one… They're cassette tapes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.13,0:18:23.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}第二\N{\fnArial\fs30}And two…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.13,0:18:27.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}黑色安息日 摩托党 金属狂热\N{\fnArial\fs30}Black Sabbath, Motorhead, Metallica?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.68,0:18:29.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这都是七八十年代的经典摇滚啦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the greatest hits of mullet rock.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:32.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老规矩 萨米 司机选音乐\N{\fnArial\fs30}House rules, Sammy… driver picks the music,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:34.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}副驾驶不要插嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}shotgun shuts his cake hole.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.35,0:18:37.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨米是胖嘟嘟的12岁男孩 这也…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yo Sammy is a chubby 12-year-old. It's…
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.65,0:18:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不好意思 我听不清 音乐太响\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, I can't hear you. The music's too loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.29,0:18:59.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.79,0:19:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}医院和太平间没有和爸爸特征相符的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. So there's no one matching dad at the hospital or morgue.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.71,0:19:05.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我猜这是个好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}So that's something, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.34,0:19:09.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}去看看什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.08,0:19:34.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.10,0:19:39.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们找到什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you guys find anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.89,0:19:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没 什么也没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.41,0:19:50.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有挣扎的痕迹 没有脚印 没指纹\N{\fnArial\fs30}No sign of struggle, no footprints, no fingerprints…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.62,0:19:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有任何痕迹 太干净了点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Spotless. It's almost too clean.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.75,0:19:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那个孩子 特洛伊\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this kid, Troy…
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.13,0:19:56.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 他和你女儿在约会 是吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's dating your daughter, isn't he? - Ya.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.09,0:19:57.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}艾米怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Amy doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.30,0:19:59.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她在市中心张贴寻人启事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's been putting up missing posters downtown.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.42,0:20:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}上个月这里也有一起类似案件 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had another one like this last month, didn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.39,0:20:05.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们是\N{\fnArial\fs30}And who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.10,0:20:07.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}联邦探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Federal marshals.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作为探员 你们俩太年轻了点吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You two are a little young for marshals, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.39,0:20:13.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢 你真会说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, that's awfully kind of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.60,0:20:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}之前有过一起类似的案件 没错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did have another one just like this, correct?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.74,0:20:16.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's right,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.69,0:20:18.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}距这里大约1英里 之前也有好几起\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a mile up the road. There have been others before that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.03,0:20:21.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么这个受害者 你认得他\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this victim… you knew him?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.49,0:20:24.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}像这样的小镇 大家都互相认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}A town like this, everybody knows everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.53,0:20:26.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}受害者除了都是男性之外\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any connection between the victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.26,0:20:27.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有什么共同之处\N{\fnArial\fs30}besides that they're all men?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.37,0:20:29.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没了 目前还没有发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. Not so far as we can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.66,0:20:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}作案手段是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's the theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.83,0:20:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说实话 我们不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly, we don't know…
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.16,0:20:34.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}连环杀手 连环绑架\N{\fnArial\fs30}Serial murderer, kidnapping ring.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.58,0:20:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我看你们这种警员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that is exactly the kind of crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.08,0:20:38.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也就只能做到这种程度了\N{\fnArial\fs30}police work I'd expect out of you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.13,0:20:40.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谢谢你的宝贵时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.59,0:20:42.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gentlemen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.85,0:20:52.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干嘛打我\N{\fnArial\fs30}What was that for?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.85,0:20:54.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干嘛踩我脚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to step on my foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.03,0:20:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}干嘛那样对警察说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why do you have to talk to police like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.69,0:20:58.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}得了吧 他们根本不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on. They don't really know what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.23,0:20:59.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们只有靠自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're all alone on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.40,0:21:00.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们想找到爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're gonna find dad,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.61,0:21:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们就要自己查清楚这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've got to get to the bottom of this thing ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.95,0:21:06.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}需要帮忙吗 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I help you boys?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.03,0:21:08.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用 警长 我们正要走\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, sir. We were just leaving.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.87,0:21:11.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}摩德探员 斯卡琳探员\N{\fnArial\fs30}Agent Mulder, agent Scully.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:20.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我敢打赌 就是她\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll bet you that's her.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.17,0:21:22.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.05,0:21:25.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你一定是艾米 - 是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You must be Amy. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.22,0:21:28.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特洛伊和我们说过你 我们是他叔叔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Troy told us about you. We're his uncles.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.06,0:21:29.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是迪恩 他是萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Dean. This is Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.35,0:21:30.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从未向我提过你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He never mentioned you to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.31,0:21:32.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特洛伊就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's Troy, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.56,0:21:34.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们不常过来 我们住在莫德斯托\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not around much. We're up in Modesto.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.27,0:21:38.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实我们也在找他 正在四处打听\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're looking for him, too, and we're kind of asking around.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.40,0:21:40.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你还好吧 - 我没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, are you okay? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.82,0:21:43.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你介意我们问你几个问题吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if we ask you a couple questions?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.07,0:21:46.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时在跟特洛伊通话 他正开车回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was on the phone with Troy. He was driving home.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.96,0:21:51.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他说很快会回电给我 但是他再也没打过\N{\fnArial\fs30}He said he would call me right back, and he never did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.26,0:21:52.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那他有没有提到一些奇怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't say anything strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.78,0:21:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或者是不寻常的事情呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or out of the ordinary?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.33,0:21:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没有 我记得什么都没有说\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, nothing I can remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.58,0:21:59.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很喜欢你的项链\N{\fnArial\fs30}I like your necklace.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.67,0:22:03.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特洛伊给我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Troy gave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.59,0:22:06.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}主要拿来吓我父母\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mostly to scare my parents…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.37,0:22:08.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你知道 恶魔崇拜什么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, the devil stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.97,0:22:13.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}实际上这恰恰相反\N{\fnArial\fs30}Actually it means just the opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.22,0:22:15.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}五芒星是个辟邪的护身符\N{\fnArial\fs30}A pentagram is a protection against evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.06,0:22:19.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}力量很强大 我是说 如果你信的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really powerfull, I mean if you believe in a kind of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.19,0:22:21.52,Title,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}很好 谢谢主持《未解之谜》\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ok, thank you, Unsolved Mysteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.77,0:22:22.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}女士们 事情是这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's the deal, ladies…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.35,0:22:26.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特洛伊失踪的方式很不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way Troy disappeared… Something's not right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.92,0:22:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以要是你们听到过任何事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}So if you've heard anything…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.91,0:22:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.49,0:22:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's just…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.49,0:22:36.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于失踪的这些人 有个传闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, with all these guys going missing, people talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.50,0:22:37.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么传闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do they talk about?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.46,0:22:43.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是本地的一个传说\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of this local legend.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.84,0:22:48.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有个女孩 几十年前在百年纪念路上被杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}This one girl, she got murdered out on Centennial like decades ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.09,0:22:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}人们猜测 她一直在那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, supposedly, she's still out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.09,0:22:55.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她搭便车 不管谁让她上了车\N{\fnArial\fs30}She hitchhikes, and whoever picks her up…
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.91,0:22:58.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}都会永远消失不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, they disappear forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.79,0:23:17.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 让我试试 - 我能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me try. - I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.96,0:23:19.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.33,0:23:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你真是个控制癖\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're such a control freak.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.21,0:23:27.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 厉鬼都是横死 对吧 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So angry spirits are born out of violent death, right? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.59,0:23:29.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许不是谋杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe it's not murder.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.35,0:23:40.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}1981年 康斯坦斯·韦尔奇 24岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was 1981. Constance Welch, 24 years old,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.23,0:23:43.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从西尔韦尼亚大桥跳下 淹死在河里\N{\fnArial\fs30}jumps off Sylvania Bridge, drowns in the river.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.23,0:23:45.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 有没有说她为何自杀 - 有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Does it say why she did it? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.40,0:23:45.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.69,0:23:49.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}尸体被发现的1小时前 她打过911\N{\fnArial\fs30}An hour before they found her, she calls 911.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.11,0:23:50.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她的两个小孩在浴缸里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Her two little kids are in the bathtub.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.76,0:23:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她离开他们一小会儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}She leaves them alone for a minute,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.28,0:23:53.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她回去的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}and when she comes back,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.49,0:23:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们没有呼吸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}they aren't breathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.45,0:23:56.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}两个都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both died.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.45,0:24:00.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}「我们的孩子不在了 康斯坦斯无法承受」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Our babies were gone, and Constance just couldn't bear it, "
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.04,0:24:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她丈夫约瑟夫·韦尔奇如是说\N{\fnArial\fs30}said husband, Joseph Welch.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.42,0:24:04.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得那桥眼熟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}That bridge look familiar to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.51,0:24:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是康斯坦斯纵身跳河的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where Constance took the swan dive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.80,0:24:15.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那么你觉得老爸曾来过这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you think dad would have been here?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.43,0:24:19.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也在查这件事 而我们在寻找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he's chasing the same story, and we're chasing him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.56,0:24:21.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 那现在该怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, so now what?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.89,0:24:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在我们继续挖掘线索直到找到他为止\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now we keep digging till we find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.44,0:24:25.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可能需要花点儿时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.65,0:24:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 迪恩 我说过我要回去的 - 星期一\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dean, I told you I've got to get back by… - Monday.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.40,0:24:32.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 有个面试\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. The interview.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:32.24,0:24:33.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 是的 - 我忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Yeah, I forgot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.45,0:24:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你是认真的 是不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're really serious about this, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.33,0:24:39.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你觉得你可以顺利当上律师\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're just gonna become some lawyer,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.91,0:24:41.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后娶你的女友\N{\fnArial\fs30}marry your girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.20,0:24:42.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许吧 有何不可\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe. Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.54,0:24:44.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西卡知道事实真相吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does Jessica know the truth about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.13,0:24:45.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她知道你做过的这些事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does she know about the things you've done?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.13,0:24:47.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 她永远不需要知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, and she's not ever going to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.75,0:24:50.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真是太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that's healthy.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:50.46,0:24:52.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能假装这是你想要的一切 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can pretend all you want, Sammy,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.24,0:24:54.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但是你迟早必须面对真实的自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}but sooner or later you're gonna have to face up to who you really are.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.38,0:24:56.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说我是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.18,0:24:57.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 我们中的一员 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- One of us. - No!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.80,0:25:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我与你们不同 我不要过这样的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not like you. This is not going to be my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.35,0:25:02.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你有责任的 - 对老爸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, you have a responsibility. - To dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.77,0:25:04.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}和他的圣战事业\N{\fnArial\fs30}And his crusade?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.81,0:25:07.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果没有照片 我甚至不知道妈妈的模样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it weren't for pictures, I wouldn't even know what mom looks like.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.27,0:25:09.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么用呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What difference would it make?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.90,0:25:12.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}即使我们找到杀她的那东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even if we do find the thing that killed her,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.86,0:25:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}妈妈也走了 不会再回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}mom's gone, and she isn't coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.87,0:25:23.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不准那样说她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't talk about her like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.42,0:25:34.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.15,0:25:48.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 她到哪里去了 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where'd she go? - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.32,0:25:56.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 这他妈… - 谁在开你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the…? - Who's driving your car?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.66,0:26:07.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快 迪恩 赶紧跑 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, Dean. Let's go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.34,0:26:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.59,0:26:35.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:38.10,0:26:38.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.73,0:26:44.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.81,0:26:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好极了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm super.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.69,0:26:54.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}车没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Car all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:54.24,0:26:55.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}恩 不管她对它做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, whatever she did to it,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.96,0:26:56.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}至少它现在没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}it seems all right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.07,0:26:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那康斯坦斯真是个贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}That Constance chick… what a bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.45,0:27:01.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可以肯定的是 她不想我们追查下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she doesn't want us digging around, that's for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.16,0:27:06.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们现在往哪里追呢 大天才\N{\fnArial\fs30}So where's the trail go from here, genius?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.92,0:27:13.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你闻起来像马桶\N{\fnArial\fs30}You smell like a toilet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.55,0:27:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一个间房 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}One room, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.60,0:27:23.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你们来搞家庭聚会还是怎么的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You guys having a reunion or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.81,0:27:24.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.81,0:27:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}另一个家伙 伯特·阿法米安\N{\fnArial\fs30}That other guy, Bert Aframian.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.02,0:27:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他在这里租了整月的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came in and bought out a room for the whole month.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.89,0:28:02.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想他至少有几天没回来过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think he's been here for a couple days at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.64,0:28:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}盐 猫眼贝\N{\fnArial\fs30}Salt, cat's-eye shells…
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.73,0:28:11.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他很担心 设法阻止什么东西进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was worried, trying to keep something from coming in.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.48,0:28:15.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有什么发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you got here?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.07,0:28:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}百年纪念公路的受害者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Centennial Highway victims.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.24,0:28:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.12,0:28:23.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我意思是不同人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, different men,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.80,0:28:26.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不同工作 年纪 种族\N{\fnArial\fs30}different jobs, age, ethnicities.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.75,0:28:28.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们之间总该有个联系 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's always a connection, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.33,0:28:30.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这些人的共性是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do these guys have in common?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.89,0:28:47.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸弄明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.82,0:28:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.81,0:28:50.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他也找到了我们看过的那篇报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}He found the same article we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.16,0:28:54.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}康斯坦斯·韦尔奇 她是白衣女鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constance Welch. She's a woman in white.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.24,0:28:58.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你这狡猾的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}You sly dogs.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.03,0:29:00.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好 如果我们要对付的是白衣女鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, so if we're dealing with a woman in white,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.78,0:29:02.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸就该已经找到她的尸体并销毁了\N{\fnArial\fs30}dad would have found the corpse and destroyed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.57,0:29:04.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她可能另有弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}She might have another weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:04.70,0:29:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 老爸一定会永绝后患\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, dad would want to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.16,0:29:07.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他会挖出她尸骸\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'd dig her up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:07.29,0:29:08.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}有说她埋在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does it say where she's buried?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.08,0:29:10.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没 我没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not that I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.42,0:29:13.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要是老爸的话 我会去问她丈夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I were dad, though, I'd go ask her husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.04,0:29:15.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果他还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}if he's still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.84,0:29:24.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 你何不查下他地址\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, why don't you see if you can find an address?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.00,0:29:25.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我去洗个澡清理下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get cleaned up.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:25.43,0:29:29.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 之前我说的那些关于爸妈的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean, what I said earlier about mom and dad…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.07,0:29:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.14,0:29:32.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}可别和我玩煽情\N{\fnArial\fs30}No chick-flick moments.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.77,0:29:36.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好吧 糙人\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right… jerk.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.69,0:29:37.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}贱人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.92,0:29:58.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是我 已经10点20分了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's me. It's about 10:20…
Dialogue: 0,0:29:58.84,0:30:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}哥们 我饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, man. I'm starving.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.54,0:30:03.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要上街弄点吃的去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna grab a little something to eat at that diner down the street.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.40,0:30:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要带点什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.68,0:30:05.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.22,0:30:06.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}阿法米安买单哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aframian's buying.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.03,0:30:26.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}快点回来 好吗 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So come home soon, okay? I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.41,0:30:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.20,0:30:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}兄弟 警察来了 快走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dude, five-O. Take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.00,0:30:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.29,0:30:35.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他们发现我了 快去找老爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, they kind of spotted me. Go find dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.84,0:30:38.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}长官 有何贵干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Problem, officers?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.21,0:30:40.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的搭档呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's your partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.71,0:30:42.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}搭档 什么 什么搭档\N{\fnArial\fs30}Partner? What? What partner?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.18,0:30:53.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}假冒美国警察 伪造信用卡\N{\fnArial\fs30}So fake U.S. Marshal, fake credit cards.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.06,0:30:55.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你什么才是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got anything that's real?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.06,0:30:56.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}胸咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}My boobs.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.90,0:31:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你有权保持缄默\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have the right to remain silent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:06.56,0:31:08.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你准备告诉我们你的真实姓名了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you want to give us your real name?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.10,0:31:11.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我告诉过你的 我叫纽金特\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told you. It's Nugent,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.43,0:31:12.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}特德·纽金特\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ted Nugent.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.57,0:31:17.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}看来你还没明白你惹上了多大的麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure you realize just how much trouble you're in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.94,0:31:19.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}您指的是 一般般的小麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're talking, like, misdemeanor kind of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:19.85,0:31:21.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还是「叫得像杀猪」的大麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}or "Squeal like a pig" trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:22.28,0:31:25.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你的墙上贴有10名失踪者的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got the faces of 10 missing persons taped to your wall,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.45,0:31:28.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}还有一大堆邪恶巫术\N{\fnArial\fs30}along with a whole lot of satanic mumbo jumbo.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.71,0:31:30.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你现在是正式的嫌犯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, you are officially a suspect.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.83,0:31:33.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}真有道理 第一起失踪案发生在82年\N{\fnArial\fs30}That makes sense because when the first one.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.62,0:31:34.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我当时只有3岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}went missing in '82, I was 3.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.34,0:31:38.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我知道你有同伙 其中一个较为年长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know you got partners. One of them's an older guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.05,0:31:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}或许他就是始作俑者\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe he started the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.68,0:31:44.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}所以告诉我 迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}So tell me, Dean…
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.22,0:31:48.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是他的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this his?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.77,0:31:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想那可能是你的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that might be your name.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.94,0:32:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我翻阅了一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, I leafed through this,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.49,0:32:02.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我能明白的少之甚少\N{\fnArial\fs30}what little I could make out.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.12,0:32:04.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我是说 简直就是不知所云\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, it's nine kinds of crazy,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.66,0:32:07.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但我也发现了这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I found this, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.45,0:32:11.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}现在 除非你告诉我这究竟是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're staying right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.10,0:32:14.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}否则你就别想离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}till you tell me exactly what the hell that means.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:26.43,0:32:29.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你是约瑟夫·韦尔奇吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, uh, are you Joseph Welch? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.48,0:32:32.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对 更老些 不过是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, he was older, but that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:32.27,0:32:35.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他三四天前来过 说他是个记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}He came by three or four days ago, said he was a reporter.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:36.02,0:32:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}对的 我们合力写篇报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's right. We're working on a story together.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.73,0:32:41.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道你们要写哪种报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I don't know what the hell kind of story.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.33,0:32:43.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他问我的那些问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're working on… the questions he asked me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.82,0:32:45.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}关于你已故的妻子 康斯坦斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}About your late wife, Constance.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.62,0:32:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他问过我她埋在何处\N{\fnArial\fs30}He asked me where she was buried.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.20,0:32:50.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你能再说一次在哪里吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And where is that again?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.46,0:32:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 这种事你要我说两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? I got to go through these twice?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.25,0:32:55.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你不介意 我想核实一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's fact checking, if you don't mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.21,0:33:01.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在布雷肯里奇我的老房子后的一块空地\N{\fnArial\fs30}In a plot behind my old place over on Breckenridge.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.26,0:33:03.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你为何要搬家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why did you move?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.22,0:33:08.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不想住在我孩子们死去的房子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not gonna live in the house where my children died.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.39,0:33:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}韦尔奇先生 你有再婚吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Welch, did you ever marry again?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.60,0:33:17.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不可能 康斯坦斯 她是我毕生最爱\N{\fnArial\fs30}No way. Constance… She was the love of my life,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.82,0:33:20.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我所认识最美丽的女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}prettiest woman I ever known.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.86,0:33:22.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这么说你的婚姻美满\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you had a happy marriage?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.78,0:33:26.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}Definitely.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.70,0:33:32.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}就这样 谢谢你腾出宝贵时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that should do it. Thanks for your time.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.01,0:33:45.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}韦尔奇先生 你有听说过白衣女鬼吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Welch, you ever hear of a woman in white?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.01,0:33:46.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}A what?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.22,0:33:50.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}白衣女鬼或哭泣女鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}A woman in white or sometimes a weeping woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.39,0:33:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是个鬼故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a ghost story.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.60,0:33:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}其实是一种现象\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's more of a phenomenon, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.23,0:33:59.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一种鬼魂 几百年来不断有人撞见\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're spirits. They've been sighted for hundreds of years,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.02,0:34:02.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}比如夏威夷和墨西哥的很多地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}dozens of places in Hawaii and Mexico,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.49,0:34:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}最近在亚利桑那州和印第安纳州\N{\fnArial\fs30}lately in Arizona, Indiana.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.28,0:34:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}每个都是不同的女子 你懂我的意思吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All these are different women, you understand,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.45,0:34:08.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但她们有共同的经历\N{\fnArial\fs30}but all share the same story.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.28,0:34:12.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不关心这些无稽之谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Boy, I don't care much for nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.62,0:34:13.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们在世的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, when they were alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.41,0:34:16.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们的丈夫都曾对她们不忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}their husbands were unfaithful to them,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.33,0:34:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}然后这些女子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and these women,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.79,0:34:20.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}在短暂的精神错乱中\N{\fnArial\fs30}basically suffering from temporary insanity,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.76,0:34:21.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杀死了自己的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}murdered their children.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.51,0:34:25.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}接着 一旦她们意识到自己做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then, once they realized what they had done,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.39,0:34:26.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们就结束了自己的生命\N{\fnArial\fs30}they took their own lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.18,0:34:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她们的灵魂受到诅咒\N{\fnArial\fs30}So now their spirits are cursed,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.26,0:34:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}游荡在公路 水路旁\N{\fnArial\fs30}walking back roads, waterways,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.60,0:34:34.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}一旦撞见不忠的男子 就会杀了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and if they find an unfaithful man, they kill him,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.10,0:34:36.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}并且那男子会永远消失不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that man is never seen again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.48,0:34:39.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.11,0:34:44.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你认为康斯坦斯与此有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think that has something to do with Constance,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.44,0:34:46.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}自作聪明的家伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}you smart ass?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.20,0:34:48.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.74,0:34:56.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许 也许我犯过一些错误\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, maybe… Maybe I made some mistakes,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.83,0:34:58.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}但不管我做过什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no matter what I did,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.17,0:35:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}康斯坦斯是不会杀死她亲生孩子的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Constance never would have killed her own children.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.34,0:35:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你给我滚出这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you get the hell out of here,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.88,0:35:07.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不准你再来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you don't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.98,0:35:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不知道告诉你多少回了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know how many times I got to tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:25.15,0:35:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这是我高中组储物箱号码\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's my high-school locker combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.19,0:35:28.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要为此耗一整夜吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna do this all night long?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.95,0:35:32.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们刚接到报警电话 怀特福特路有枪击\N{\fnArial\fs30}We just got a 911. Shots fired over at Whiteford Road.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.99,0:35:35.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你要不要上洗手间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have to go to the bathroom?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.16,0:35:36.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.12,0:35:38.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.17,0:36:31.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}谎报警 萨米 严重违法哟\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fake 911 phone call, Sammy? That's pretty illegal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.63,0:36:32.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.51,0:36:33.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着 我们要谈一谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we got to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.89,0:36:36.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}说吧 她丈夫确有不忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell me about it. So the husband was unfaithful.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:36.72,0:36:38.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们要对付的就是白衣女鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are dealing with a woman in white.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.47,0:36:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她埋在她的老房子后面\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's buried behind her old house.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.92,0:36:42.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 你能安静一会儿吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy, would you shut up for a second?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.31,0:36:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白老爸为何还没有销毁尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't figure out why he hasn't destroyed the corpse yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.63,0:36:46.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}那就是我正要告诉你的 他离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what I'm trying to tell you. He's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:47.48,0:36:48.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}老爸离开了耶利哥\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dad left Jericho.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.61,0:36:50.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}什么 你是怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? How do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.28,0:36:52.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我拿到了他的日记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got his journal.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.28,0:36:53.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}他从不离身的日记本\N{\fnArial\fs30}He doesn't go anywhere without that thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:54.07,0:36:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}没错 但他这次没带着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, he did this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.24,0:36:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}里面有说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's it say?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.03,0:36:57.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}退役陆战队员的老把戏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same old ex-Marine crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.64,0:36:59.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}当他想让我们知道他去了哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}when he wants to let us know where he's going.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.20,0:37:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}经纬坐标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.00,0:37:01.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where to?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.00,0:37:02.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我还不能确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not sure yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.21,0:37:04.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我不明白 有什么事如此重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't understand. I mean, what can be so important.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.39,0:37:06.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}让他工作进行一半就离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}that he just gets out in the middle of the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.92,0:37:08.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩 这到底是怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, what the hell is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.13,0:37:13.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam, Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.93,0:37:21.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.35,0:37:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}带我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me home.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.40,0:37:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.02,0:38:15.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}别这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.86,0:38:19.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我永远回不了家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can never go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.29,0:38:24.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你害怕回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're scared to go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.14,0:38:32.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}抱紧我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.26,0:38:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我好冷\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.14,0:38:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不能杀我 我没有不忠\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't kill me. I'm not unfaithful.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.35,0:38:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}从来都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never been.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.40,0:38:44.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你将会有的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You will be.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:47.39,0:38:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}只要抱紧我就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just hold me.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:29.07,0:39:30.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我来带你回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.86,0:39:33.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.54,0:39:46.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 萨姆 - 我在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sam! - Here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.34,0:39:47.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.17,0:39:49.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我想是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.63,0:39:51.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}- 你能动吗 - 能 帮我一把\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Can you move? - Yeah. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.15,0:40:55.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你回来看我们了 妈妈\N{\fnArial\fs30}You've come home to us, mommy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:33.44,0:41:35.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是她淹死她孩子们的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}So this is where she drowned her kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.07,0:41:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}这就是她说永不回家的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why she could never go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.33,0:41:42.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}她害怕面对他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}She was too scared to face them.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.37,0:41:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你找到了她的弱点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You found her weak spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.41,0:41:46.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好样的 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice work, Sammy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.29,0:41:51.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我希望我能对你说同样的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wish I could say the same for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.55,0:41:53.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你怎么会想到朝鬼魂开枪 你个怪胎\N{\fnArial\fs30}What were you thinking shooting Casper in the face, you freak?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:53.92,0:41:56.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我可救了你一命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, saved your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:57.34,0:41:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要再告诉你件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you another thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:58.92,0:42:00.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你再弄坏我的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you screwed up my car,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.93,0:42:03.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我会杀了你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:15.69,0:42:17.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 这就是老爸去的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, here's where dad went.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:17.05,0:42:18.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}科罗拉多州的布莱克伯特山\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's called Blackbottle Ridge, Colorado.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.20,0:42:21.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}听着挺诱人 多远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds charming. How far?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.91,0:42:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}大概六百英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}About 600 miles.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:25.45,0:42:27.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果我们加速 一早就能就到达\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we shag ass, we can make it by morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.71,0:42:31.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, um…
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.84,0:42:34.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你不想去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not going.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.01,0:42:37.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我要赶回去 离面试只有十小时了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The interview's in 10 hours. I got to be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.26,0:42:46.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 好 随便吧 我送你回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Yeah, whatever. I'll take you home.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.95,0:43:08.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}如果你找到老爸就打电话给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll call me if you find him?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:11.46,0:43:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}也许我可以晚点去和你们汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe I can meet up with you later, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:13.50,0:43:14.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}好 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:18.34,0:43:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.18,0:43:24.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你看 我们又合作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we made a hell of a team back there.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.18,0:43:26.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:46.03,0:43:46.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess!
Dialogue: 0,0:43:48.79,0:43:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}你在家吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You home!?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.08,0:44:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.96,0:44:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.96,0:44:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:39.46,0:44:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}萨姆 萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam! Sam!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:42.22,0:44:44.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.97,0:44:47.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}杰西 杰西 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jess! Jess! No!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:33.73,0:45:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,{\blur3}我们有活儿干了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got work to do.
